tip: | Look at the cow. | A long body on four legs, turned along the grid, with a big square head. It faces the same way a car would.
tip: 1 | A box with a head. | The body is a box on the grid, so it sits on tiles like a crate. Four short legs and a tail make it an animal.
tip: 3 | Patches wrap around. | A dark patch runs over the back and on down the side, changing shape at the corner. Spots that ignore the corner look printed on.
tip: 4 | The nose says cow. | The pink muzzle, a step or two along its own ramp, is the part nobody could mistake.
